# Capstone Project - Web Apps with AI

#### Unit 6 is the Semester 2 capstone, where students design and build a purposeful web app for a real audience. They apply technical skills, human-centered design, and AI literacy while making transparent, ethical choices. 

#### The emphasis is on both creating and reflecting—showing how thoughtful, values-driven design leads to confident, intentional creators.

#### **Project Title:** Capstone Project
#### **Unit:** Unit 6 - Capstone Project
#### **Final Product Type:** Complete Web Application (with API integration, documentation, and reflection)
#### **Student Role or Framing Device:** Students act as intentional designers and developers, rotating through professional roles (software engineer, UX researcher, product manager, ethical technologist)
#### **When Project Begins:** Final two weeks of the semester (full duration of Unit 6)


